{"id":"aa8eb6d4b3069a9b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/503_俄罗斯构造数学系统_RUSS.md","title":"503 俄罗斯构造数学系统 RUSS","display":"503_俄罗斯构造数学系统_RUSS","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>唯一排序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N\">\\(\\mathsf N\\)</span>。变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{503}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{503}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{503}(X)=v_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{503}(X)=v_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0,\\quad S,\\quad +,\\quad \\cdot\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0,\\quad S,\\quad +,\\quad \\cdot\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0:\\mathsf N\">\\(0:\\mathsf N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N\">\\(S:\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\cdot:\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N\">\\(+,\\cdot:\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N\\)</span>。关系符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi:\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N,\\mathsf N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\)</span> 表示对象语言中的三元原子公式；它不是外部可计算函数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与量词自由片段\">2. 项、公式与量词自由片段</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小项集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t+u,t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(t+u,t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\">\\(A\\land B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\">\\(A\\lor B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,A,\\exists x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\forall x\\,A,\\exists x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>量词自由片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\">\\(A\\land B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\">\\(A\\lor B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\)</span> 中。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}\">\\(\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(S t)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(S t)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{503}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(e)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(x)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(e)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(x)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\exists x\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(\\exists x\\,A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{503}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{503}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{503}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{503}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\exists x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(\\exists x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{503}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{503}\">\\(\\operatorname{Subt}_{503}\\)</span> 在变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 上分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}\\)</span> 的非量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,u,w)[x:=t]=\\Phi(e[x:=t],u[x:=t],w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi(e,u,w)[x:=t]=\\Phi(e[x:=t],u[x:=t],w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词子句如下。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x,\\qquad y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\ne x,\\qquad y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{503}(\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{503}(\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{503}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Qz\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(B,y,z),x,t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Qz\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(B,y,z),x,t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是第三种情形的结果。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span> 上所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;),(B,B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;),(B,B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Qx\\,A,Qx\\,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((Qx\\,A,Qx\\,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Qx\\,A,Qz\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(A,x,z))\\in E\">\\((Qx\\,A,Qz\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{503}(A,x,z))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>直觉主义命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{503}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{503}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{503}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{503}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{503}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{503}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自然数公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{503}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{503}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall x\\,A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall x\\,A):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Church 论题族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CTOK}_{503}(A,x,y,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\ \\land\\\nx,y,e\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\ \\land\\\n|\\{x,y,e\\}|=3\\ \\land\\\ne\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CTOK}_{503}(A,x,y,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\ \\land\\\nx,y,e\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\ \\land\\\n|\\{x,y,e\\}|=3\\ \\land\\\ne\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,e\">\\(x,y,e\\)</span> 在项位置分别表示同名变量项；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\)</span> 的三个实参均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{503}\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\">\\(e\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(A)\\)</span> 保证新加的实现者量词不捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的自由变量。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists e\\,\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\land A):\n\\operatorname{CTOK}_{503}(A,x,y,e)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists e\\,\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\land A):\n\\operatorname{CTOK}_{503}(A,x,y,e)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Markov 族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}\n=\n\\{(((\\exists x\\,A)\\to\\bot)\\to\\bot)\\to\\exists x\\,A:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}\n=\n\\{(((\\exists x\\,A)\\to\\bot)\\to\\bot)\\to\\exists x\\,A:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{503}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{503}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{503}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{503}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{503}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则、证明与可证性\">5. 规则、证明与可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{503}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{503}=\\{((A),\\forall x\\,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{503}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{503}=\\{((A),\\forall x\\,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-重命名规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{B}\n\\qquad\n(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{B}\n\\qquad\n(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并形式化为类型化前提组—结论关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{503}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((A),B\\bigr)\n:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}B\n\\right\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{503}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((A),B\\bigr)\n:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,503}B\n\\right\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是长度为 1 的前提组集合。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{503}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{503}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{503}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{503}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{503}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{503}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{503}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{503}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{503}(G)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{503}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{503}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{503}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{503}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{503}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n(\\operatorname{last}_{503}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{503}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{503}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n(\\operatorname{last}_{503}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-目标区分\">6. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是同时加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{503}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{503}\\)</span>，并以三元原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\)</span> 表示对象语言内的递归计算图。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个句法形式系统\">7. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RUSS}_{503}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{503},\\mathsf{Tm}_{503},\\mathsf{Frm}_{503},\\mathsf{QF}_{503}